.claude/

# The blog folder is mostly working files. Publish the post, its stylesheet,
# the markdown source it is built from, and the assets that have to be live
# on the web: the .svg and .mp4 the page loads, plus the .png renders the
# dev.to copy hotlinks. The .gif copies (7.6 MB — uploaded to dev.to by
# hand), the screen recording, the diagram preview page and the generated
# blog/export/ stay local.
blog/*
!blog/Blog.md
!blog/index.html
!blog/blog.css
!blog/media/
blog/media/*
!blog/media/*.svg
!blog/media/*.mp4
!blog/media/*.png
